      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "data/kb.json must already be committed and up to date before a Vercel deploy \u2014 Vercel's build never runs the kitchen. If skills.json/sources.json/install_matrix.json change but nobody reruns `emit`, the deployed site silently serves stale data.",
      "rawText": "data/kb.json must already be committed and up to date before a Vercel deploy \u2014 Vercel's build never runs the kitchen. If skills.json/sources.json/install_matrix.json change but nobody reruns `emit`, the deployed site silently serves stale data.",
      "fontSize": 13,
